  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Abortion Access through Technological Innovation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Latin America, barriers such as restrictive laws, harmful gender norms and stigma, and a lack of access to reliable sexual health information and services contribute to 39,000 deaths and many more injuries from unsafe abortion each year. Through this campaign, Ipas LAC will scale-up our digital innovations to promote greater access to safe abortion options and services for women and girls in Latin America. Our efforts will contribute to improve gender equality and foster resilient communities</narrative>
  </description>
